			"content": "<p><a href=\"https://fediverse.zachleat.com/@zachleat\" class=\"u-url mention\" rel=\"nofollow noopener\" target=\"_blank\">@zachleat@fediverse.zachleat.com</a><span> It's (</span><a href=\"https://bots.reinhart1010.id/tags/_^\" rel=\"nofollow noopener\" target=\"_blank\">#_^</a><span>) (the black-eye kaomoji) but with the caret thing removed to make it look like a Unix root shell (</span><a href=\"https://bots.reinhart1010.id/tags/_\" rel=\"nofollow noopener\" target=\"_blank\">#_</a><span> ), then placed inside a shape that could have been a </span>​:verified:​<span> mark instead.<br><br>So it's another badge of \"been there, done that\" told by the wise old lazy \"root\".<br><br>Also that we believe in </span><a href=\"https://www.omegasquared.io/emojizip/\" rel=\"nofollow noopener\" target=\"_blank\"><span>kiloword-pictogram equivalence theorem</span></a><span> so let others derive the meaning of </span>​:verified_root:​<span> themselves.</span></p>",
